WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Fate has its own destiny

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,320
This is about letting nature take its course.

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,400
Can't force it

4
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,760
You still have a long time to live

5
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,860
There is no need to rush

6
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,780
Now our Song family has opened many shops in Chang'an

7
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,900
Your father's restless temper

8
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,220
Even if it's snowing, I have to go to the shop and take a look.

9
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,180
No one can stop it

10
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,660
Wait until he comes back and knows that you are coming home today

11
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,980
I'm sure I'll be angry again and I won't be able to see you. It's okay.

12
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:24,420
I won’t go back to the Hou Mansion today

13
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:29,100
I want to stay at home for a few days.

14
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:33,310
Take Ah Chi to study some books

15
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:36,960
What happened to you and the prince?

16
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,120
None

17
00:00:38,120 --> 00:00:39,840
It’s difficult to travel on the windy and snowy road today

18
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,480
He specially prepared the carriage for me when I went out.

19
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:45,640
Ayu and his wife get along with each other and continue to have a cold war with each other
